  (text "A FREE BIT is an R-KEY-PU and nothing else: no switch, no series resistor, no capacitor. A floating CMOS input is\nthe fault R-KEY-PU exists to fix. Three instances: left_thumb B and A, left_hand A (allocation.yaml).\nThe MARKER STRAPS are traces, not parts: each board wires its two marker inputs straight to the rails." (at 20.32 140.97 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 9fb8127a-7470-58d0-923e-4128023e2806))
